@startuml modbus-stack
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontSize 13

node "Home Control Service" {
  [MODBUS Client\n(Java / Python)] as MC
}

node "Network" {
  [RS485<->Ethernet\nSerial Server\n(TCP port 502)] as NET
}

node "RS485 Bus" {
  [Analog Output Module\n(addr 1)] as M1
  [Analog Input Module\n(addr 2)] as M2
  [30-ch Relay Module\n(addr 3)] as M3
  [Blauberg MVHR\n(addr 4 -- proprietary MODBUS)] as M4
}

MC --> NET : MODBUS TCP
NET --> M1
NET --> M2
NET --> M3
NET --> M4 : MODBUS RTU over RS485
@enduml
